[ prieto-márquez2011c_fig3: Hadrosauroid strict consensus, root at the lower left, read by eye; fully resolved. Hadrosauroidea, Hadrosauridae, Saurolophidae, Saurolophinae and Lambeosaurinae are kept on their nodes; HADROSAURINAE, bracketed beside Hadrosaurus foulkii alone, is not encoded. Stars and support values are not encoded. The tree rises to the upper right; every node is rectangular. 48 tips, fully resolved; 5 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Sample 9 case (census 3, seed 20261272). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

